            <ArticleTitle>Managing pain in a diverse medical-surgical patient population.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>469-74, 486</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>A joint research and quality assurance task force was established to evaluate pain management practices. Medical and surgical patients and their nurses were surveyed about patient pain during the hospitalization and a plan for pain assessment and management was developed.</AbstractText>
